OL,3,GNEWSAMum charged with her baby
OL,4,Adaughter's murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother has been charged with the
OL,7,Fmurder of her 17-month-old daughter,
OL,8,Fwith the girl's grandmother accused of
OL,9,Fchild cruelty and allowing the death.
OL,11,FFaiza Hassan, 36, of Dudley, appeared
OL,12,Fat Wolverhampton Crown Court on
OL,13,FThursday where in addition to murder
OL,14,Fshe was accused of child cruelty
OL,15,Ftowards the girl and eight counts of
OL,16,Fwounding with intent.
OL,18,FShe was remanded in custody ahead of
OL,19,Fher next appearance at the same court
OL,20,Fset for 9 October.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
